---
source: misc/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: "help_output(\"waitpid\")"
---
Wait for arbitrary processes to exit

Usage: waitpid [OPTIONS] <PIDS>...

Arguments:
  <PIDS>...  PIDs to wait for

Options:
  -v, --verbose            Be more verbose
  -t, --timeout <TIMEOUT>  Maximum number of seconds to wait
  -e, --exited             Don't error on already-exited PIDs
  -c, --count <COUNT>      Number of process exits to wait for
  -h, --help               Print help
